# The repo root .gitignore has a bare `build/` rule (for Python/packaging build
# output). It matches src/screens/build/ — the entire Build SCREEN — and silently
# drops it from every commit. Re-include it explicitly. Same trap the parity lane
# hit with its `baseline/design-demo/build/` directory; see web/parity/.gitignore.
# Do not delete this, and add a sibling line for any future screen called `build`.
!src/screens/build/
